# What the release build is made from: the Studio's own dependencies and the
# tool that freezes it. requirements-release.txt pins each of them and
# everything they need, with hashes, and the build installs only that.
# docs/development.md, "Making a release", says how to refresh it.
-r requirements.txt
pyinstaller
# PyInstaller needs these two on Windows only, and says so with a marker, so a
# lock compiled anywhere else (Dependabot compiles on Linux) left them out, and
# the build on windows-latest stopped at the freeze. Named here, they are in the
# lock wherever it is compiled. Both are pure Python.
pefile
pywin32-ctypes
